' === DELIVERY STATUS FLOW ===
note as DeliveryFlow
**DELIVERY STATUS FLOW:**

[Pending] → [Preparing] → [Ready] → [Out for Delivery] → [Delivered] → [Completed]

**Status Definitions:**
• Pending: Order received, awaiting preparation
• Preparing: Staff preparing the package
• Ready: Package ready for driver pickup
• Out for Delivery: Driver en route
• Delivered: Package received by customer
• Completed: Customer confirmed receipt
end note

' === NOTES ===
note bottom of UC52
**Delivery Management:**
• View all assigned deliveries
• Assign drivers to deliveries
• Real-time tracking
• Handle delivery issues
• Generate delivery reports
end note

note bottom of UC53
**Assign Driver Process:**
1. View available drivers
2. Select appropriate driver
3. Assign vehicle
4. Set delivery route
5. Set estimated delivery time
end note

note bottom of UC54
**Update Delivery Status:**
• Preparing → Mark items being packed
• Ready → Mark ready for pickup
• Shipped → Driver picked up
• Delivered → Customer received
end note

note bottom of UC55
**Delivery Proof Requirements:**
• Photo of delivered package (required)
• Customer/receiver signature (required)
• GPS coordinates of delivery location
• Receiver name & contact
• Delivery time timestamp
• Condition of package
end note

note bottom of UC57
**Operations Management:**
• Fleet: Vehicles & capacity
• Schedule: Driver shift management
• Area: Delivery coverage zones
• Driver: Driver profiles & availability
end note

